  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 15 year rows (明治43, 44, 昭和4-14 under 決算; 昭和15 under 豫算) as printed; the 昭和2-3 years are not printed. Section rows 決算 / 豫算 are printed centred headings. Year labels printed as 明治/昭和 + 年度 number with ditto marks; written out in full here. Unit (圓) for 歲入, 歲出 and 歲入超過 amounts; indices unitless.",
   "Checks (python3): 歲入 總額 = 經常部 + 臨時部 and 歲出 總額 = 經常部 + 臨時部 reconcile in all 15 rows; 歲入超過 = 歲入總額 - 歲出總額 reconciles in all 14 rows where printed (昭和15 prints —). Indices not checked.",
   "明治43年度 歲入指數 and 歲出指數 are a printed dash."
  ],
